.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH pt 1  "pt 3.12.1"
.SH NAME
pt \- Sovereign task manager for PureTensor
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpt\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-idempotency\-key\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Sovereign task manager for PureTensor
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<DB>\fR
Override the SQLite path (default: $PTASK_DB or ~/puretensor\-tasks/tasks.db)
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Emit machine\-readable JSON instead of human text (task\-facing verbs)
.TP
\fB\-\-idempotency\-key\fR \fI<IDEMPOTENCY_KEY>\fR
Idempotency key recorded with the mutation\*(Aqs event — a retried command with the same key returns ok without re\-applying
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
pt\-add(1)
Create a new task
.TP
pt\-list(1)
List tasks
.TP
pt\-done(1)
Mark a task done (by PT\-N or title substring)
.TP
pt\-priority(1)
Promote/demote a task\*(Aqs priority (critical|urgent|high|normal|low or 1..=5)
.TP
pt\-edit(1)
Edit task fields
.TP
pt\-reopen(1)
Reopen a completed/dismissed task (status → pending)
.TP
pt\-show(1)
Show one task\*(Aqs full row + side\-table detail
.TP
pt\-dismiss(1)
Dismiss a task (soft close, status → dismissed; reversible via reopen)
.TP
pt\-rm(1)
Delete a task permanently (hard delete + tombstone)
.TP
pt\-next(1)
Show ready\-to\-start tasks (all dependencies done)
.TP
pt\-plan(1)
Advisory day plan: fit the ready queue into calendar free/busy (dry\-run unless \-\-write). Reads free slots via gcalendar.py; \-\-write adds tentative events to our own calendar only
.TP
pt\-view(1)
Manage saved views
.TP
pt\-tui(1)
Launch the terminal UI (ratatui)
.TP
pt\-serve(1)
Run the HTTP server (sync API, capture, webhooks, metrics)
.TP
pt\-bot(1)
Run the Telegram bot (Bot API long\-poll)
.TP
pt\-mcp(1)
Serve the MCP server over stdio (agent\-native tool surface)
.TP
pt\-digest(1)
Session\-priming digest: recent done/dismissed/created + ready queue
.TP
pt\-export(1)
Export tasks/links/labels as JSONL (optionally git\-commit the export)
.TP
pt\-delegate(1)
Print the operator\-gated delegation command for a task (skeleton)
.TP
pt\-branch(1)
Print a Linear\-style branch name for a task
.TP
pt\-distill(1)
Run the native Rust distillation pipeline
.TP
pt\-accountability(1)
Run one accountability cycle (escalation + Telegram/email)
.TP
pt\-scoring(1)
Recompute composite priority scores for all active tasks
.TP
pt\-remote(1)
Talk to a remote canonical `pt serve` (no local DB)
.TP
pt\-start(1)
Mark a task in progress (you\*(Aqre actively working it)
.TP
pt\-snooze(1)
Snooze a task until a date — it leaves `pt next` and reminders, then wakes to todo automatically
.TP
pt\-reap(1)
Reap stale machine\-generated tasks (incident >7d idle, distilled >30d idle) — soft\-dismiss, reversible via `pt reopen`
.TP
pt\-depend(1)
Manage dependency edges: PT\-A depends on PT\-B
.TP
pt\-review(1)
Interactive review sweep: stale, snoozed\-expired, and triage items
.TP
pt\-search(1)
Full\-text search over titles + descriptions (FTS5)
.TP
pt\-why(1)
Explain a task\*(Aqs composite score: components, weights, rank
.TP
pt\-bulk(1)
Apply one action to every task matching a filter DSL expression
.TP
pt\-log(1)
Show a task\*(Aqs attributed event history (who did what, via which surface)
.TP
pt\-undo(1)
Reverse the most recent undoable mutation (done/dismiss/create)
.TP
pt\-token(1)
Manage named scoped API tokens (create/list/revoke)
.TP
pt\-backfill(1)
One\-shot backfill PT\-N for any tasks lacking one
.TP
pt\-gen\-manpage(1)
Generate the `pt(1)` manpage to stdout
.TP
pt\-gen\-completions(1)
Generate shell completions (bash/zsh/fish) to stdout
.TP
pt\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH VERSION
v3.12.1
